{{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'llama3.2', format: 'json', prompt: 'Analyze the invoice text and extract data into a JSON object. STRICT RULES:\n1. The CLIENT/BUYER is ALWAYS related to \'Innovatek\', \'Alejandro Calvo\', or \'YUNIQ\'. The PROVIDER/SENDER (empresa_nombre) MUST NOT be these names. Look for the real provider.\n2. If a field is missing, output \'No disponible\'.\n3. factura_numero: Invoice number.\n4. factura_fecha: Issue date.\n5. empresa_nombre: PROVIDER/SENDER name.\n6. empresa_cif: PROVIDER VAT.\n7. empresa_direccion: PROVIDER address.\n8. empresa_telefono: PROVIDER phone.\n9. cliente_nombre: CLIENT/BUYER name.\n10. cliente_cif: CLIENT VAT.\n11. cliente_direccion: CLIENT address.\n12. base_imponible_total: Subtotal before taxes (number only).\n13. iva_total: Total tax amount (number only).\n14. total_factura: Final total (number only). Ensure Base + IVA = Total.\n15. cuenta_bancaria_iban: IBAN.\n16. metodo_pago: Payment method.\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Text: ' + (($json.results && $json.results[0]) ? $json.results[0].content : ($json.text || '')).substring(0, 4000), stream: false }) }}
